振り返れば 少女は消えた
When I looked back, the girl had vanished.

581
00:47:28,140 --> 00:47:29,940
私ずっと
All along, I've been...

582
00:47:29,940 --> 00:47:32,540
夢の中ね
...inside a dream, haven't I?

583
00:47:39,640 --> 00:47:41,940
